1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:30,000
= kisskh.asia =

2
00:00:12,530 --> 00:00:20,530
♪ From primal chaos to the starry sky ♪

3
00:00:20,580 --> 00:00:28,340
♪ In the whole world, we shall hold the balance ♪

4
00:00:44,920 --> 00:00:46,916
♪ The cauldron tempers divine blades ♪

5
00:00:46,940 --> 00:00:50,810
♪ The furnace refines the empty void ♪

6
00:00:52,820 --> 00:00:54,906
♪ The Way is in mystic fate ♪

7
00:00:54,930 --> 00:00:58,720
♪ Be brave enough to split the primal chaos wide open ♪

8
00:01:36,380 --> 00:01:37,596
[Pull Strings]

9
00:01:37,620 --> 00:01:39,436
[Adapted from the novel by Yan Gui Zheng Zhuan]

10
00:01:39,460 --> 00:01:42,300
[Episode 22]

11
00:01:44,640 --> 00:01:46,330
At that time, I was barely conscious.

12
00:01:47,510 --> 00:01:49,230
I could only entrust this great undertaking

13
00:01:49,510 --> 00:01:50,740
to you and Jiu Wu.

14
00:01:52,230 --> 00:01:53,230
You two

15
00:01:54,510 --> 00:01:57,460
truly united the Three Sects.

16
00:01:59,680 --> 00:02:01,660
I am truly gratified.

17
00:02:03,920 --> 00:02:04,920
Senior.

18
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:11,000
Senior,

19
00:02:11,360 --> 00:02:12,450
is it because.

20
00:02:12,870 --> 00:02:14,820
I didn't persuade Aunt Jiu Jiu to come

21
00:02:15,190 --> 00:02:16,190
that Uncle Jiu Wu.

22
00:02:17,960 --> 00:02:18,960
I'm sorry.

23
00:02:19,190 --> 00:02:20,290
It's not your fault.

24
00:02:22,560 --> 00:02:24,380
Mentor was worried about us,

25
00:02:25,590 --> 00:02:27,690
so he had Uncle Jiu Wu look after us.

26
00:02:34,080 --> 00:02:36,540
You can never truly know someone's heart.

27
00:02:42,960 --> 00:02:43,980
Uncle Jiu Wu.

28
00:02:46,840 --> 00:02:47,840
I'll play weiqi with you

29
00:02:49,400 --> 00:02:51,340
in the next life.

30
00:03:08,310 --> 00:03:11,060
You promised me you'd come back.

31
00:03:12,680 --> 00:03:13,680
Liar.

32
00:03:24,800 --> 00:03:26,656
I was the one supposed to go.

33
00:03:26,680 --> 00:03:28,570
The one who should have died was me.

34
00:03:29,560 --> 00:03:31,100
Why you?

35
00:03:33,470 --> 00:03:34,730
Get up.

36
00:03:35,750 --> 00:03:37,540
Get up!

37
00:03:38,630 --> 00:03:40,010
I am deeply ashamed.

38
00:03:40,280 --> 00:03:41,540
The pearl of our sect

39
00:03:42,120 --> 00:03:43,980
can actually be used like this.

40
00:03:44,240 --> 00:03:45,240
Changgeng,

41
00:03:45,680 --> 00:03:47,780
what spell did you just use?

42
00:03:48,120 --> 00:03:51,220
That's one of my Montage Art tricks.

43
00:03:51,310 --> 00:03:52,310
It's called

44
00:03:52,960 --> 00:03:54,290
the CAG special effect.

45
00:03:54,560 --> 00:03:56,166
It can add new content at will

46
00:03:56,190 --> 00:03:57,940
in this pearl image,

47
00:03:58,400 --> 00:03:59,610
turning it into an illusion.

48
00:03:59,960 --> 00:04:00,960
Montage...

49
00:04:01,030 --> 00:04:02,056
Montage...

50
00:04:02,080 --> 00:04:03,290
CAG?

51
00:04:03,870 --> 00:04:04,870
An illusion?

52
00:04:09,960 --> 00:04:11,260
The world's magic

53
00:04:12,150 --> 00:04:13,940
is truly ever-changing.

54
00:04:14,080 --> 00:04:15,450
I am again enlightened.

55
00:04:15,960 --> 00:04:16,696
Changgeng,

56
00:04:16,720 --> 00:04:18,096
your mastery is so profound.

57
00:04:18,120 --> 00:04:19,286
Why don't you do it yourself?

58
00:04:19,310 --> 00:04:21,930
Why use my hands for this illusion?

59
00:04:22,310 --> 00:04:25,980
I'm a carefree wandering immortal,

60
00:04:26,120 --> 00:04:27,726
dragged into this mess for no reason,

61
00:04:27,750 --> 00:04:29,486
already entangled in too much karma.

62
00:04:29,510 --> 00:04:31,670
The credit for resolving the crisis of the Three Sects

63
00:04:31,720 --> 00:04:33,370
shall go to you.

64
00:04:33,600 --> 00:04:35,050
Indifferent to fame and fortune,

65
00:04:35,750 --> 00:04:36,980
and of remarkable attainment.

66
00:04:37,120 --> 00:04:38,730
I've learned much today.

67
00:04:38,800 --> 00:04:40,930
Then I must trouble you as well.

68
00:04:41,750 --> 00:04:42,870
As you've seen for yourself,

69
00:04:42,920 --> 00:04:45,046
this has nothing to do with our sect.

70
00:04:45,070 --> 00:04:47,290
It's that Westdawn causing all the trouble.

71
00:04:48,950 --> 00:04:52,050
Please pass word to your sect's sage.

72
00:04:52,120 --> 00:04:53,726
Of course, of course.

73
00:04:53,750 --> 00:04:54,750
Many thanks.

74
00:04:58,240 --> 00:04:59,240
Hermit,

75
00:04:59,480 --> 00:05:01,050
what of the item I entrusted to you?

76
00:05:04,560 --> 00:05:05,780
I'm ashamed.

77
00:05:07,830 --> 00:05:10,780
I couldn't tell what treasure it was,

78
00:05:10,870 --> 00:05:12,926
but it drew hordes of demons from all around.

79
00:05:12,950 --> 00:05:14,930
They swarmed me.

80
00:05:15,560 --> 00:05:17,370
I couldn't hold them off alone.

81
00:05:17,600 --> 00:05:18,900
What do you mean?

82
00:05:19,560 --> 00:05:20,576
You didn't lose it, did you?

83
00:05:20,600 --> 00:05:22,100
Why didn't you lose yourself too?

84
00:05:22,600 --> 00:05:23,600
I've had it.

85
00:05:25,310 --> 00:05:27,100
I've wronged you, Changgeng.

86
00:05:27,270 --> 00:05:28,166
I willingly accept punishment.

87
00:05:28,190 --> 00:05:29,576
Forget about punishment.

88
00:05:29,600 --> 00:05:30,976
What good is punishing you now?

89
00:05:31,000 --> 00:05:32,096
You lost his stuff.

90
00:05:32,120 --> 00:05:33,406
Pay 50,000 spirit stones.

91
00:05:33,430 --> 00:05:34,220
How much?

92
00:05:34,310 --> 00:05:35,510
Or give me that pearl instead.

93
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:37,290
Hermit, do not blame yourself.

94
00:05:37,560 --> 00:05:38,170
The pearl.

95
00:05:38,390 --> 00:05:39,780
I have

96
00:05:40,120 --> 00:05:41,730
foreseen this.

97
00:05:42,270 --> 00:05:44,810
To gain, there must be loss.

98
00:05:45,510 --> 00:05:46,980
Since loss is inevitable,

99
00:05:47,510 --> 00:05:49,540
why not turn this loss to advantage?

100
00:05:50,120 --> 00:05:52,486
Westdawn Sect wants the Pregenesis Sword.

101
00:05:52,510 --> 00:05:54,150
That's why they attacked Ascendance Sect.

102
00:05:54,510 --> 00:05:55,730
But little do they know

103
00:05:56,160 --> 00:05:58,700
that I only have one fragment.

104
00:05:59,270 --> 00:06:02,490
So, they must seek the other two fragments.

105
00:06:03,190 --> 00:06:04,366
Thus...

106
00:06:04,390 --> 00:06:06,020
We can surely lure them out.

107
00:06:09,920 --> 00:06:10,696
Wait.

108
00:06:10,720 --> 00:06:11,926
Since you want to discard it,

109
00:06:11,950 --> 00:06:13,930
why make me guard it?

110
00:06:14,390 --> 00:06:15,726
How did you even become an immortal?

111
00:06:15,750 --> 00:06:16,896
If we leave it for someone to take,

112
00:06:16,920 --> 00:06:18,366
isn't that obviously a trap?

113
00:06:18,390 --> 00:06:20,930
Your guarding it makes the ruse more real.

114
00:06:21,950 --> 00:06:22,950
I'm speechless.

115
00:06:23,120 --> 00:06:24,220
It really is.

116
00:06:24,560 --> 00:06:26,286
The traitor Kuai Si said

117
00:06:26,310 --> 00:06:28,536
that Westdawn Sect is set up in the East Sea.

118
00:06:28,560 --> 00:06:30,776
They'll soon trigger the Great Tribulation.

119
00:06:30,800 --> 00:06:32,246
We must lure them out asap.

120
00:06:32,270 --> 00:06:33,430
Then what are we waiting for?

121
00:06:33,480 --> 00:06:35,490
Let's charge into the East Sea now.

122
00:06:35,560 --> 00:06:36,580
No, no.

123
00:06:36,750 --> 00:06:38,486
The East Sea is the Dragon Clan's territory.

124
00:06:38,510 --> 00:06:39,896
If you just storm in there,

125
00:06:39,920 --> 00:06:41,700
it'll surely spark a human-dragon war.

126
00:06:41,920 --> 00:06:43,456
That would make things far worse.

127
00:06:43,480 --> 00:06:44,490
Then what do you suggest?

128
00:06:45,680 --> 00:06:48,140
Ascendance Sect has long had ties with the Dragon Palace.

129
00:06:48,920 --> 00:06:51,930
We need only send a small team inside

130
00:06:52,120 --> 00:06:53,366
to root out the hidden mastermind.

131
00:06:53,390 --> 00:06:55,030
Then, we can avert the Great Tribulation.

132
00:06:56,600 --> 00:06:58,100
You're humans.

133
00:06:58,480 --> 00:07:00,050
Will they let you enter

134
00:07:00,190 --> 00:07:01,536
without reason?

135
00:07:01,560 --> 00:07:02,560
Don't worry.

136
00:07:02,920 --> 00:07:04,980
I still hold a hidden trump card.

137
00:07:06,430 --> 00:07:08,220
Greetings, Grandlord.

138
00:07:09,920 --> 00:07:10,930
The Sea Deity Sect

139
00:07:11,360 --> 00:07:14,460
is vast in territory, with countless disciples,

140
00:07:14,680 --> 00:07:17,730
but I roam afar, hard to govern.

141
00:07:17,870 --> 00:07:21,050
To ensure the Sea Deity Sect endures forever,

142
00:07:21,270 --> 00:07:22,340
today,

143
00:07:22,870 --> 00:07:24,370
I formally declare

144
00:07:24,510 --> 00:07:25,510
the appointment

145
00:07:25,870 --> 00:07:28,780
of Ao Yi, Second Prince of the East Sea,

146
00:07:28,870 --> 00:07:30,576
as the Second Grandlord

147
00:07:30,600 --> 00:07:32,366
and Azure Protector

148
00:07:32,390 --> 00:07:34,020
to act as Grandlord.

149
00:07:34,750 --> 00:07:37,540
I...

150
00:07:37,600 --> 00:07:38,600
How could I deserve this?

151
00:07:39,190 --> 00:07:40,370
No need to refuse.

152
00:07:48,800 --> 00:07:50,850
I saw you turn into a golden dragon,

153
00:07:50,950 --> 00:07:53,136
fight off the demons,

154
00:07:53,160 --> 00:07:56,250
and save everyone.

155
00:07:56,750 --> 00:07:58,780
You are already a great hero.

156
00:07:59,510 --> 00:08:03,776
I...

157
00:08:03,800 --> 00:08:04,840
Am I already a great hero?

158
00:08:05,950 --> 00:08:07,700
I know

159
00:08:09,680 --> 00:08:10,960
you've always dreamed of leading

160
00:08:11,000 --> 00:08:12,850
the Dragon Clan back to glory.

161
00:08:13,680 --> 00:08:17,456
That's right.

162
00:08:17,480 --> 00:08:18,220
Then, now

163
00:08:18,360 --> 00:08:19,730
is the time.

164
00:08:20,270 --> 00:08:21,900
You can return to the Dragon Palace

165
00:08:22,360 --> 00:08:24,016
as the Second Grandlord

166
00:08:24,040 --> 00:08:26,366
and the Azure Protector.

167
00:08:26,390 --> 00:08:29,020
Then, your father and brother

168
00:08:29,390 --> 00:08:31,540
will see how strong you've grown

169
00:08:31,920 --> 00:08:35,180
after what you've been through.

170
00:08:37,000 --> 00:08:38,000
Yes, Grandlord.

171
00:08:38,320 --> 00:08:39,420
This time,

172
00:08:39,870 --> 00:08:42,370
I will crush Westdawn Sect's plot

173
00:08:42,870 --> 00:08:44,130
to pieces.

174
00:08:44,480 --> 00:08:46,250
As expected of Changgeng.

175
00:08:47,360 --> 00:08:49,296
You're nothing like what I heard.

176
00:08:49,320 --> 00:08:50,460
You heard about me?

177
00:08:52,750 --> 00:08:54,730
What did you hear about me?

178
00:08:54,870 --> 00:08:56,010
I heard it from my sister.

179
00:08:56,720 --> 00:08:59,056
She said you dodge trouble when you can

180
00:08:59,080 --> 00:09:01,096
and are selfish, given to despair,

181
00:09:01,120 --> 00:09:02,176
wallow in self-pity,

182
00:09:02,200 --> 00:09:03,200
and...

183
00:09:03,750 --> 00:09:05,060
You know what I mean.

184
00:09:07,080 --> 00:09:08,366
But seeing you today,

185
00:09:08,390 --> 00:09:10,180
you truly have a heroic air.

186
00:09:10,360 --> 00:09:12,890
My sister's view is too shallow.

187
00:09:14,510 --> 00:09:15,510
You're right.

188
00:09:17,910 --> 00:09:19,130
The old Changgeng

189
00:09:19,870 --> 00:09:21,490
would never have formulated

190
00:09:22,320 --> 00:09:24,100
a plan to strike first.

191
00:09:24,480 --> 00:09:25,526
I used to think

192
00:09:25,550 --> 00:09:27,460
that everything was under my control

193
00:09:27,750 --> 00:09:29,250
and that everything in this world

194
00:09:30,000 --> 00:09:32,420
would unfold as I envisioned.

195
00:09:34,600 --> 00:09:35,730
But I was wrong.

196
00:09:37,390 --> 00:09:38,530
My avoidance

197
00:09:39,720 --> 00:09:42,340
only let those demons run wilder,

198
00:09:42,870 --> 00:09:45,340
causing irreparable harm.

199
00:09:46,360 --> 00:09:47,530
From this day forward,

200
00:09:48,910 --> 00:09:50,890
I will no longer hide.

201
00:09:51,200 --> 00:09:53,460
Even if the Great Tribulation arrives,

202
00:09:53,960 --> 00:09:55,700
I will also give it a try.

203
00:09:56,270 --> 00:09:58,490
I will show Fate

204
00:09:59,600 --> 00:10:00,640
that the Great Tribulation

205
00:10:00,840 --> 00:10:02,770
does not come and go as it pleases.

206
00:11:01,720 --> 00:11:02,720
Mentor,

207
00:11:03,080 --> 00:11:04,370
sorry

208
00:11:06,750 --> 00:11:07,910
about the Transformation Art.

209
00:11:10,720 --> 00:11:11,730
You've worked so hard.

210
00:11:13,720 --> 00:11:14,890
Rest for a while.

211
00:11:17,750 --> 00:11:19,420
My heart is now empty.

212
00:11:21,480 --> 00:11:23,770
Nothing left at all.

213
00:11:26,120 --> 00:11:27,820
Sit with me for a while.

214
00:11:32,870 --> 00:11:33,870
Not yet.

215
00:11:34,790 --> 00:11:38,300
The sect must escort the Second Prince back.

216
00:11:39,510 --> 00:11:40,850
The Second Prince named me

217
00:11:41,480 --> 00:11:42,770
to accompany him.

218
00:11:49,550 --> 00:11:51,580
I never knew you were this busy.

219
00:11:52,510 --> 00:11:53,510
No, wait.

220
00:11:54,320 --> 00:11:55,730
You were busy before too,

221
00:11:57,080 --> 00:11:59,100
but I never knew what kept you so occupied.

222
00:12:02,910 --> 00:12:03,910
Go on.

223
00:12:06,000 --> 00:12:08,100
After all, I used to be alone

224
00:12:09,750 --> 00:12:12,130
in Jade Division.

225
00:12:14,670 --> 00:12:16,980
I can endure this loneliness.

226
00:12:19,390 --> 00:12:20,390
Go on.

227
00:12:43,480 --> 00:12:45,340
This jade talisman had Kuai Si's demonic arts.

228
00:12:45,910 --> 00:12:46,910
Kuai Si is dead.

229
00:12:47,510 --> 00:12:48,910
So, the demonic arts are dispelled.

230
00:12:54,600 --> 00:13:00,140
♪ See mortal joys and sorrows ♪

231
00:13:00,980 --> 00:13:07,740
♪ Reunions and partings, as fate unfolds ♪

232
00:13:09,250 --> 00:13:15,180
♪ Alas, love has many twists and turns ♪

233
00:13:15,760 --> 00:13:22,510
♪ Memories filled with sorrow ♪

234
00:13:23,080 --> 00:13:30,190
♪ Slowly, wishes turn to regret ♪

235
00:13:30,360 --> 00:13:31,360
Junior Qi Yuan,

236
00:13:32,480 --> 00:13:33,920
since I left without saying goodbye,

237
00:13:34,030 --> 00:13:35,340
it's been many years.

238
00:13:36,200 --> 00:13:37,980
Is all well in Jade Division?

239
00:13:38,670 --> 00:13:40,730
Mentor and I are in Kuru Land,

240
00:13:41,120 --> 00:13:42,980
seeking herbs to restore your foundation.

241
00:13:44,390 --> 00:13:45,976
Mortals always envy us cultivators

242
00:13:46,000 --> 00:13:47,650
for having a path to eternal life.

243
00:13:48,150 --> 00:13:49,750
A thousand years pass in a blink for us.

244
00:13:50,670 --> 00:13:51,890
But they do not know this:

245
00:13:53,000 --> 00:13:55,130
Even parted mortals feel each day is a year.

246
00:13:55,510 --> 00:13:57,220
How can separated cultivators

247
00:13:58,600 --> 00:14:01,130
bear a thousand years of longing?

248
00:14:01,870 --> 00:14:03,610
So what if we have magic power?

249
00:14:04,240 --> 00:14:06,580
So what if we can live long?

250
00:14:07,510 --> 00:14:08,510
Sometimes, I think

251
00:14:09,390 --> 00:14:10,846
it's fine to trade for a few decades together.

252
00:14:10,870 --> 00:14:11,366
Set out.

253
00:14:11,390 --> 00:14:13,530
With these cultivation bodies

254
00:14:14,030 --> 00:14:14,987
of ours.

255
00:14:15,011 --> 00:14:16,766
[Hall of Mystic Truth]

256
00:14:16,790 --> 00:14:17,940
Whenever I think of this,

257
00:14:18,600 --> 00:14:20,010
I lie awake at night.

258
00:14:21,390 --> 00:14:22,390
But then I think

259
00:14:23,030 --> 00:14:24,650
once I've restored your foundation,

260
00:14:25,510 --> 00:14:27,890
we can be together for eons.

261
00:14:28,720 --> 00:14:30,200
Wouldn't that be even more beautiful?

262
00:14:31,790 --> 00:14:33,420
Kuru Land is perilous,

263
00:14:34,630 --> 00:14:36,490
yet some corners are truly breathtaking.

264
00:14:38,510 --> 00:14:39,526
At times, I think

265
00:14:39,550 --> 00:14:40,770
that if we both ascended,

266
00:14:41,360 --> 00:14:42,646
I'd surely bring you here,

267
00:14:42,670 --> 00:14:44,310
and we'd be wandering immortals together.

268
00:14:46,080 --> 00:14:47,340
Could such a day come?

269
00:14:49,200 --> 00:14:50,200
Junior,

270
00:14:50,790 --> 00:14:52,010
I will surely return.

271
00:14:53,080 --> 00:14:55,420
However long it'll take,

272
00:14:55,910 --> 00:14:57,420
I'll return someday.

273
00:14:58,360 --> 00:14:59,060
So,

274
00:14:59,360 --> 00:15:00,490
you must stay alive

275
00:15:00,790 --> 00:15:01,790
and wait for me.

276
00:15:03,270 --> 00:15:04,366
If you dare lose heart

277
00:15:04,390 --> 00:15:05,770
and abandon this cultivation path,

278
00:15:06,750 --> 00:15:08,180
I will not forgive you.

279
00:15:12,840 --> 00:15:13,840
Senior,

280
00:15:15,550 --> 00:15:17,180
I'll remember you.

281
00:15:17,840 --> 00:15:20,340
You'll always be in my heart.

282
00:15:21,170 --> 00:15:28,490
♪ Slowly, wishes turn to regret ♪

283
00:15:28,760 --> 00:15:35,610
♪ You've gone afar, like mist fading ♪

284
00:15:39,340 --> 00:15:42,980
[Hall of Mystic Truth]

285
00:15:43,570 --> 00:15:45,970
♪ Past fragments ♪

286
00:15:46,220 --> 00:15:50,846
♪ Vanish into night ♪

287
00:15:50,870 --> 00:15:53,060
[Jade Division]

288
00:16:24,240 --> 00:16:25,420
My Blood Gnats

289
00:16:27,750 --> 00:16:29,530
have been completely wiped out?

290
00:16:30,720 --> 00:16:32,650
Defeated Wen Jing,

291
00:16:32,790 --> 00:16:34,530
do you admit your guilt?

292
00:16:34,720 --> 00:16:35,720
I'm Wen Jing.

293
00:16:36,360 --> 00:16:37,646
Greetings, Two Saints of Westdawn.

294
00:16:37,670 --> 00:16:39,336
[Jieyin, Saint of Westdawn Sect] You've failed to seize...

295
00:16:39,360 --> 00:16:40,886
[Zhunti, Saint of Westdawn Sect] The Pregenesis Sword.

296
00:16:40,910 --> 00:16:42,030
Sorry for being incompetent.

297
00:16:42,320 --> 00:16:43,530
Incompetent?

298
00:16:45,150 --> 00:16:48,130
The army was dispatched, yet all efforts were in vain.

299
00:16:48,320 --> 00:16:50,340
You have sabotaged our sect's grand plan.

300
00:16:50,390 --> 00:16:51,980
What punishment do you deserve?

301
00:16:52,320 --> 00:16:53,650
I failed in proper planning.

302
00:16:54,150 --> 00:16:55,180
I'm unforgivable!

303
00:16:55,320 --> 00:16:57,010
Yet Ascendance Sect was gravely wounded.

304
00:16:57,510 --> 00:16:59,370
Seizing and Human Sects became sworn foes.

305
00:16:59,480 --> 00:17:00,056
I think...

306
00:17:00,080 --> 00:17:01,080
Foolish!

307
00:17:01,320 --> 00:17:02,320
Arrogant!

308
00:17:11,070 --> 00:17:12,810
You think your petty puppetry spell

309
00:17:13,480 --> 00:17:15,290
can fool Voidcity?

310
00:17:15,640 --> 00:17:18,220
We covered for you,

311
00:17:18,720 --> 00:17:20,620
yet you exposed yourself.

312
00:17:22,440 --> 00:17:25,330
Voidcity has likely noticed you.

313
00:17:25,960 --> 00:17:28,380
Our sect now faces exposure.

314
00:17:28,750 --> 00:17:30,860
Should the Three Sects investigate,

315
00:17:31,310 --> 00:17:33,140
our sect may not withstand it.

316
00:17:33,790 --> 00:17:35,050
Now, we can only

317
00:17:35,480 --> 00:17:39,216
kill the demons to prove our innocence.

318
00:17:39,240 --> 00:17:40,240
No, no!

319
00:17:40,310 --> 00:17:41,010
Please, no!

320
00:17:41,200 --> 00:17:42,200
No!

321
00:17:43,350 --> 00:17:45,090
I'm begging you.

322
00:17:45,920 --> 00:17:47,180
I committed the guilt

323
00:17:47,550 --> 00:17:49,220
and wrongs alone.

324
00:17:49,680 --> 00:17:50,810
Should punishment come,

325
00:17:51,640 --> 00:17:53,490
I will bear it all.

326
00:17:53,920 --> 00:17:55,940
I beg you to grant this.

327
00:17:56,310 --> 00:17:57,310
Too late.

328
00:17:59,350 --> 00:18:01,490
I've already destroyed three-tenths

329
00:18:01,920 --> 00:18:04,660
of your clan left in the Blood Sea.

330
00:18:04,830 --> 00:18:06,136
I also destroyed

331
00:18:06,160 --> 00:18:07,570
another three-tenths.

332
00:18:07,920 --> 00:18:10,700
The Two Saints of Westdawn punish the wicked

333
00:18:11,030 --> 00:18:14,180
to avenge the Ascendance Sect.

334
00:18:14,920 --> 00:18:15,920
Thus,

335
00:18:16,240 --> 00:18:19,860
the Three Sects won't doubt us.

336
00:18:20,550 --> 00:18:22,660
The fate of the remaining

337
00:18:22,830 --> 00:18:24,660
four-tenths of your clan

338
00:18:25,680 --> 00:18:28,940
depends on your future conduct.

339
00:18:29,790 --> 00:18:31,140
You must understand

340
00:18:31,640 --> 00:18:33,730
that all this karma

341
00:18:34,350 --> 00:18:38,090
stems from your crushing defeat today.

342
00:18:44,160 --> 00:18:45,160
Thanks

343
00:18:47,270 --> 00:18:48,770
for your grace.

344
00:18:50,790 --> 00:18:52,980
I will not disappoint you again.

345
00:18:53,720 --> 00:18:55,290
Go to the East Sea at once.

346
00:18:55,480 --> 00:18:57,140
Meet Jin Chan there.

347
00:18:57,960 --> 00:19:00,380
Jin Chan has the Pregenesis Sword.

348
00:19:00,790 --> 00:19:02,250
The Eye of the East Sea

349
00:19:02,790 --> 00:19:05,010
will open soon.

350
00:19:08,220 --> 00:19:12,900
[When the demons attacked Ascendance Sect.]

351
00:20:00,920 --> 00:20:01,920
Lie down.

352
00:20:04,920 --> 00:20:06,250
A python swallowed you.

353
00:20:06,590 --> 00:20:08,090
You were nearly destroyed.

354
00:20:09,030 --> 00:20:10,030
Luckily,

355
00:20:10,790 --> 00:20:11,900
you met me.

356
00:20:27,160 --> 00:20:28,290
You cannot speak

357
00:20:28,400 --> 00:20:29,400
and have no memory.

358
00:20:30,070 --> 00:20:32,420
When I found you, you were barely alive.

359
00:20:32,680 --> 00:20:33,680
From now on,

360
00:20:34,160 --> 00:20:35,660
we'll call you Cansheng.

361
00:20:44,110 --> 00:20:45,110
Who are you?

362
00:20:56,920 --> 00:20:58,290
The sea of suffering is endless.

363
00:20:59,000 --> 00:21:00,480
Turn back, and you'll find the shore.

364
00:21:04,440 --> 00:21:05,640
You lost the Pregenesis Sword?

365
00:21:05,960 --> 00:21:07,290
The situation was critical.

366
00:21:07,480 --> 00:21:09,220
Only the Sword fragment could bait them.

367
00:21:09,270 --> 00:21:10,216
It was our only way to survive.

368
00:21:10,240 --> 00:21:11,570
You gave me your word

369
00:21:11,640 --> 00:21:13,380
that your fragment would be safe.

370
00:21:13,550 --> 00:21:15,290
They came for the Sword.

371
00:21:15,480 --> 00:21:17,570
If all three fragments were in the Celestial Court,

372
00:21:17,790 --> 00:21:19,286
the Westdawn Sect would attack directly.

373
00:21:19,310 --> 00:21:21,090
The aftermath would be unimaginable.

374
00:21:26,720 --> 00:21:27,720
That's not wrong.

375
00:21:27,960 --> 00:21:29,570
We barely have forces.

376
00:21:30,310 --> 00:21:31,310
We couldn't hold it.

377
00:21:35,270 --> 00:21:36,290
Thanks for the warning.

378
00:21:36,920 --> 00:21:37,920
I'll hide

379
00:21:38,480 --> 00:21:39,900
my fragment carefully.

380
00:21:43,550 --> 00:21:44,660
Actually,

381
00:21:45,270 --> 00:21:48,660
I've come for your fragment.

382
00:21:51,310 --> 00:21:52,656
Ascendance Sect had this battle

383
00:21:52,680 --> 00:21:53,616
because we were

384
00:21:53,640 --> 00:21:55,490
too conservative in strategy.

385
00:21:55,550 --> 00:21:56,616
Even the strongest defense

386
00:21:56,640 --> 00:21:58,940
can't hold against repeated attacks.

387
00:22:01,400 --> 00:22:02,176
That's true.

388
00:22:02,200 --> 00:22:04,940
Since the enemy openly aims for the Sword,

389
00:22:05,070 --> 00:22:07,290
we should turn defense into offense

390
00:22:07,480 --> 00:22:08,640
and end this threat for good.

391
00:22:11,200 --> 00:22:14,490
So, you deliberately let the Demon Clan

392
00:22:15,030 --> 00:22:16,656
take the Sword fragment.

393
00:22:16,680 --> 00:22:18,420
Though Westdawn Sect hasn't surfaced,

394
00:22:18,510 --> 00:22:20,376
they must have already slipped into the Dragon Palace.

395
00:22:20,400 --> 00:22:22,180
This is our only chance to flush them out.

396
00:22:22,480 --> 00:22:24,616
Once Westdawn Sect sees that fragment,

397
00:22:24,640 --> 00:22:25,176
they will...

398
00:22:25,200 --> 00:22:26,730
They'll seek out the other fragments.

399
00:22:27,070 --> 00:22:28,006
Your Majesty, you're wise.

400
00:22:28,030 --> 00:22:29,696
I happen to have a fragment.

401
00:22:29,720 --> 00:22:30,566
How wise of you.

402
00:22:30,590 --> 00:22:32,090
I can lure them out,

403
00:22:32,240 --> 00:22:33,566
reveal their true, ugly faces,

404
00:22:33,590 --> 00:22:34,870
and catch them all in one sweep.

405
00:22:35,030 --> 00:22:36,030
Exactly.

406
00:22:38,000 --> 00:22:39,900
You want me to give you the fragment?

407
00:22:42,200 --> 00:22:44,380
The Sword has three fragments.

408
00:22:44,590 --> 00:22:46,896
Even if the Westdawn Sect seizes two fragments,

409
00:22:46,920 --> 00:22:47,856
they still can't

410
00:22:47,880 --> 00:22:49,726
unlock its original power

411
00:22:49,750 --> 00:22:51,326
to open the Eye of the East Sea.

412
00:22:51,350 --> 00:22:52,350
Therefore,

413
00:22:52,510 --> 00:22:54,270
as long as Fairy Yunxiao's fragment is safe,

414
00:22:54,440 --> 00:22:56,566
risking my fragment is acceptable.

415
00:22:56,590 --> 00:22:57,810
You are right.

416
00:23:00,920 --> 00:23:02,050
Still, it's a little risky.

417
00:23:02,240 --> 00:23:03,456
I will devise a solid plan.

418
00:23:03,480 --> 00:23:05,246
And I will ensure everything

419
00:23:05,270 --> 00:23:06,510
goes exactly according to plan.

420
00:23:07,240 --> 00:23:09,180
This plan hardly seems your doing.

421
00:23:09,310 --> 00:23:10,790
Aren't you known for playing it safe?

422
00:23:12,510 --> 00:23:13,530
I just think

423
00:23:14,240 --> 00:23:15,240
that one

424
00:23:15,510 --> 00:23:17,730
should sometimes try

425
00:23:18,240 --> 00:23:19,530
something a bit risky.

426
00:23:20,420 --> 00:23:23,260
[Li Changshou]

427
00:23:24,960 --> 00:23:26,696
Connect! Connect!

428
00:23:26,720 --> 00:23:27,696
This is so serious.

429
00:23:27,720 --> 00:23:28,460
Connect!

430
00:23:28,680 --> 00:23:30,176
Should we bring Fairy Yunxiao in

431
00:23:30,200 --> 00:23:30,936
to help us out?

432
00:23:30,960 --> 00:23:31,960
No.

433
00:23:32,000 --> 00:23:32,656
We're already risking

434
00:23:32,680 --> 00:23:34,486
two fragments.

435
00:23:34,510 --> 00:23:36,050
We must not involve her further.

436
00:23:36,880 --> 00:23:39,770
We even need to control her whereabouts

437
00:23:40,030 --> 00:23:41,330
to keep her from showing up.

438
00:23:41,400 --> 00:23:42,730
Connect!

439
00:23:43,160 --> 00:23:43,976
[Fairy Yunxiao] Connect!

440
00:23:44,000 --> 00:23:45,490
That's Fairy Yunxiao.

441
00:23:45,550 --> 00:23:47,190
She appears and vanishes without a trace.

442
00:23:47,590 --> 00:23:48,726
Even Heaven reach Master

443
00:23:48,750 --> 00:23:50,860
can't find her.

444
00:23:52,720 --> 00:23:54,700
You used to find her all the time, right?

445
00:23:56,720 --> 00:23:57,860
Now that you mention it,

446
00:24:00,880 --> 00:24:02,246
every time she came to me before,

447
00:24:02,270 --> 00:24:04,090
it was her Resonance that summoned me.

448
00:24:04,510 --> 00:24:06,330
I've never actively gone looking for her.

449
00:24:11,480 --> 00:24:13,616
Maybe she's left some Resonance

450
00:24:13,640 --> 00:24:14,900
for you in some remote corner?

451
00:24:18,200 --> 00:24:19,490
I don't think so.

452
00:24:20,480 --> 00:24:21,480
But

453
00:24:22,480 --> 00:24:23,480
that's just as well.

454
00:24:24,110 --> 00:24:26,250
If we can't find her, we'll avoid her.

455
00:24:26,590 --> 00:24:27,860
It'll have the same effect.

456
00:24:28,790 --> 00:24:30,530
So, you're planning

457
00:24:31,200 --> 00:24:32,220
to never see her again?

458
00:24:37,640 --> 00:24:39,420
Between you and Fairy Yunxiao,

459
00:24:40,070 --> 00:24:41,090
what happened?

460
00:24:42,920 --> 00:24:43,920
Nothing.

461
00:24:46,960 --> 00:24:48,770
During the crisis at Ascendance Sect,

462
00:24:49,200 --> 00:24:51,380
Fairy Yunxiao stormed my Hall of Soaring Heaven.

463
00:24:55,440 --> 00:24:57,660
She summoned the Grand Mage of Voidcity.

464
00:24:59,590 --> 00:25:00,590
She said

465
00:25:01,640 --> 00:25:03,140
she won't contact you anymore.

466
00:25:16,070 --> 00:25:17,070
So be it.

467
00:25:17,640 --> 00:25:18,640
With her out of the way,

468
00:25:18,880 --> 00:25:20,046
we can now carry out

469
00:25:20,070 --> 00:25:21,330
our East Sea plan.

470
00:25:24,550 --> 00:25:25,570
You two argued.

471
00:25:26,510 --> 00:25:28,696
Fairy Yunxiao is such an important person.

472
00:25:28,720 --> 00:25:29,330
I...

473
00:25:29,640 --> 00:25:30,766
How could a lowly disciple like me

474
00:25:30,790 --> 00:25:32,376
ever rein her in?

475
00:25:32,400 --> 00:25:34,566
I simply want her to be free,

476
00:25:34,590 --> 00:25:36,010
far from all turmoil.

477
00:25:36,200 --> 00:25:37,570
That would satisfy me.

478
00:25:39,920 --> 00:25:41,656
Your Majesty, may I speak?

479
00:25:41,680 --> 00:25:43,250
I have another request.

480
00:25:45,310 --> 00:25:46,376
This East Sea plan

481
00:25:46,400 --> 00:25:48,286
will inevitably clash with Westdawn Sect.

482
00:25:48,310 --> 00:25:49,616
I need many more weapons and instruments.

483
00:25:49,640 --> 00:25:50,640
None.

484
00:25:51,070 --> 00:25:51,856
I haven't even finished.

485
00:25:51,880 --> 00:25:53,326
How would you know there aren't any?

486
00:25:53,350 --> 00:25:54,460
Really, there's none.

487
00:25:55,200 --> 00:25:56,570
The Celestial Court is vast.

488
00:25:56,720 --> 00:25:57,856
There must be some instruments.

489
00:25:57,880 --> 00:25:58,976
You're being so stingy!

490
00:25:59,000 --> 00:25:59,486
Hand them over!

491
00:25:59,510 --> 00:26:00,730
There were some before.

492
00:26:01,000 --> 00:26:02,000
Now, they're gone.

493
00:26:03,110 --> 00:26:04,616
What do you mean?

494
00:26:04,640 --> 00:26:05,326
That's impossible.

495
00:26:05,350 --> 00:26:06,460
You must have some.

496
00:26:06,510 --> 00:26:07,860
Why would I lie?

497
00:26:07,920 --> 00:26:09,810
Didn't Fairy Yunxiao come by once?

498
00:26:10,110 --> 00:26:11,286
So what if she came by?

499
00:26:11,310 --> 00:26:12,806
The Court's weapons and magic instruments

500
00:26:12,830 --> 00:26:13,896
were all taken.

501
00:26:13,920 --> 00:26:15,090
All taken?

502
00:26:15,240 --> 00:26:16,240
Yeah.

503
00:26:17,790 --> 00:26:18,790
Take what?

504
00:26:19,030 --> 00:26:20,390
Who's trying to take things again?

505
00:26:22,110 --> 00:26:25,050
Only one way in or out of the Dragon Palace.

506
00:26:25,310 --> 00:26:26,896
If a fire broke out,

507
00:26:26,920 --> 00:26:28,010
we'd be trapped.

508
00:26:28,070 --> 00:26:29,220
You fool.

509
00:26:29,510 --> 00:26:31,176
The Dragon Palace is all water.

510
00:26:31,200 --> 00:26:32,810
How could there be a fire?

511
00:26:33,000 --> 00:26:34,000
That's true.

512
00:26:34,640 --> 00:26:36,460
[Token] It's all part of His Majesty's plan.

513
00:26:36,720 --> 00:26:37,920
Without the Dragon Gate Token,

514
00:26:38,310 --> 00:26:40,090
no one can invade our East Sea.

515
00:26:40,310 --> 00:26:42,220
Who'd dare attack the East Sea?

516
00:26:42,550 --> 00:26:43,550
Tell me.

517
00:26:43,790 --> 00:26:44,976
We'll go report

518
00:26:45,000 --> 00:26:46,526
the Little Prince's return.

519
00:26:46,550 --> 00:26:47,486
If His Majesty is pleased,

520
00:26:47,510 --> 00:26:49,086
might he grant us a reward?

521
00:26:49,110 --> 00:26:50,110
Maybe.

522
00:26:52,100 --> 00:26:53,340
[Token]

523
00:26:55,440 --> 00:26:56,440
Alright.

524
00:26:57,200 --> 00:26:58,200
Drink.

525
00:26:59,310 --> 00:27:01,176
Your Majesty! Your Majesty!

526
00:27:01,200 --> 00:27:02,200
You two.

527
00:27:02,350 --> 00:27:02,936
Turtle.

528
00:27:02,960 --> 00:27:03,486
Your Majesty.

529
00:27:03,510 --> 00:27:04,566
Perfect timing. Come, come.

530
00:27:04,590 --> 00:27:05,766
Drink with me.

531
00:27:05,790 --> 00:27:06,696
I'll pass for now.

532
00:27:06,720 --> 00:27:07,726
Urgent report, Your Majesty!

533
00:27:07,750 --> 00:27:09,290
The Second Prince is back.

534
00:27:09,400 --> 00:27:10,530
Second Prince?

535
00:27:11,070 --> 00:27:12,220
What's this "second"?

536
00:27:13,270 --> 00:27:14,246
How many sons do I have?

537
00:27:14,270 --> 00:27:16,456
Your Majesty, your second son, Ao Yi.

538
00:27:16,480 --> 00:27:17,490
He's back.

539
00:27:23,920 --> 00:27:24,920
Exactly.

540
00:27:26,510 --> 00:27:27,090
Ao Yi?

541
00:27:27,240 --> 00:27:28,240
Yes, yes!

542
00:27:29,350 --> 00:27:31,810
No, he barely left.

543
00:27:32,110 --> 00:27:34,220
So, he couldn't handle it outside

544
00:27:34,920 --> 00:27:35,726
and came back?

545
00:27:35,750 --> 00:27:36,750
Yes.

546
00:27:37,110 --> 00:27:38,700
It looks like Yi

547
00:27:39,750 --> 00:27:41,490
still hasn't grown up.

548
00:27:42,110 --> 00:27:43,250
Your Majesty!

549
00:27:46,400 --> 00:27:47,940
Do you all know what day it is?

550
00:27:49,310 --> 00:27:51,180
The Second Prince is coming back.

551
00:27:51,590 --> 00:27:52,726
It's a joyful day, a good thing.

552
00:27:52,750 --> 00:27:53,616
So cheer up, everyone.

553
00:27:53,640 --> 00:27:54,726
Smile, smile!

554
00:27:54,750 --> 00:27:55,616
When you play later,

555
00:27:55,640 --> 00:27:56,700
give it your all.

556
00:27:56,750 --> 00:27:58,900
Make my little brother happy.

557
00:28:02,110 --> 00:28:03,110
Father.

558
00:28:03,440 --> 00:28:04,940
The band is all ready.

559
00:28:06,070 --> 00:28:09,090
The Little Prince is young, after all.

560
00:28:09,240 --> 00:28:11,770
It's his first time out. Setbacks are inevitable.

561
00:28:12,270 --> 00:28:14,896
A little dragon, first time out.

562
00:28:14,920 --> 00:28:16,286
What majesty could he have?

563
00:28:16,310 --> 00:28:17,696
Back when I was out there,

564
00:28:17,720 --> 00:28:19,856
I endured so many hardships.

565
00:28:19,880 --> 00:28:20,880
Father.

566
00:28:20,920 --> 00:28:22,700
Things are not like your time anymore.

567
00:28:22,880 --> 00:28:25,250
No matter how much he suffered outside,

568
00:28:25,510 --> 00:28:26,896
as long as he comes back home,

569
00:28:26,920 --> 00:28:28,290
we'll shower him with love.

570
00:28:28,440 --> 00:28:30,216
He's our little treasure, after all.

571
00:28:30,240 --> 00:28:31,290
Little treasure.

572
00:28:33,030 --> 00:28:34,620
The little treasure's here.

573
00:28:37,350 --> 00:28:38,900
He's here! Play the music!

574
00:28:52,160 --> 00:28:53,160
He's back!

575
00:28:54,030 --> 00:28:54,526
Stop the music!

576
00:28:54,550 --> 00:28:55,660
Stop, stop!

577
00:28:56,510 --> 00:28:57,700
Yi.

578
00:28:58,270 --> 00:28:59,176
- No.
- Your Majesty!

579
00:28:59,200 --> 00:28:59,766
- You're back.
- Your Majesty!

580
00:28:59,790 --> 00:29:00,526
I've missed you so much.

581
00:29:00,550 --> 00:29:01,326
Your Majesty, this isn't...

582
00:29:01,350 --> 00:29:02,326
Wrong, wrong.

583
00:29:02,350 --> 00:29:03,726
Wrong, wrong.

584
00:29:03,750 --> 00:29:04,136
Wrong.

585
00:29:04,160 --> 00:29:04,700
Yi.

586
00:29:05,030 --> 00:29:05,810
Your Majesty, Your Majesty.

587
00:29:05,960 --> 00:29:06,960
Yi is not so chubby.

588
00:29:07,000 --> 00:29:07,700
My Yi.

589
00:29:07,750 --> 00:29:09,180
How did you get so round, Yi?

590
00:29:09,350 --> 00:29:10,710
What on earth have you been eating

591
00:29:10,830 --> 00:29:11,830
to end up like this?

592
00:29:12,310 --> 00:29:13,420
Greetings, Dragon King.

593
00:29:14,160 --> 00:29:16,290
Who are you?

594
00:29:16,960 --> 00:29:17,960
Hello, everyone.

595
00:29:18,110 --> 00:29:20,570
We are of the Sea Deity Sect.

596
00:29:20,920 --> 00:29:22,766
By order of our Grandlord,

597
00:29:22,790 --> 00:29:24,976
we are escorting Ao Yi, Second Grandlord

598
00:29:25,000 --> 00:29:27,180
and Azure Protector,

599
00:29:27,240 --> 00:29:28,176
back to the East Sea.

600
00:29:28,200 --> 00:29:28,940
The Sea Deity Sect?

601
00:29:29,030 --> 00:29:29,810
Second Grandlord?

602
00:29:29,920 --> 00:29:30,920
Azure Protector?

603
00:29:31,000 --> 00:29:32,530
Isn't this the East Sea?

604
00:29:32,680 --> 00:29:34,770
What is the Sea Deity Grandlord?

605
00:29:35,070 --> 00:29:36,700
How come I've never heard of him?

606
00:29:36,750 --> 00:29:38,900
Our Grandlord is called.

607
00:29:39,310 --> 00:29:41,090
Changgeng the Great.

608
00:29:41,790 --> 00:29:42,900
Changgeng?

609
00:29:43,030 --> 00:29:44,050
Changgeng again.

610
00:29:44,400 --> 00:29:45,700
Here it comes again!

611
00:29:47,070 --> 00:29:47,806
Here it comes!

612
00:29:47,830 --> 00:29:48,940
Music! Music!

613
00:29:57,030 --> 00:29:58,030
Stop.

614
00:29:59,310 --> 00:30:00,330
Yi, my boy.

615
00:30:00,830 --> 00:30:02,086
- Yi, you're finally back!
- That's my...

616
00:30:02,110 --> 00:30:02,976
Your Majesty.

617
00:30:03,000 --> 00:30:03,616
I've missed you dearly.

618
00:30:03,640 --> 00:30:04,286
Your Majesty, your Majesty.

619
00:30:04,310 --> 00:30:05,856
Wrong again, wrong again!

620
00:30:05,880 --> 00:30:06,266
- What's wrong?
- Your Majesty.

621
00:30:06,290 --> 00:30:07,176
It's wrong again.

622
00:30:07,200 --> 00:30:08,240
How did he become a woman?

623
00:30:08,440 --> 00:30:10,046
It's been so long, and Yi is a woman.

624
00:30:10,070 --> 00:30:11,070
Greetings, Dragon King.

625
00:30:11,960 --> 00:30:12,960
You...

626
00:30:15,240 --> 00:30:16,900
Didn't you break off our betrothal?

627
00:30:17,720 --> 00:30:19,250
So, you are no longer one of us.

628
00:30:19,480 --> 00:30:20,600
Then why are you here today?

629
00:30:20,920 --> 00:30:22,526
Today, I'm not

630
00:30:22,550 --> 00:30:23,700
your follower.

631
00:30:24,000 --> 00:30:26,486
I am Ao Yi's personal guard.

632
00:30:26,510 --> 00:30:27,216
Personal?

633
00:30:27,240 --> 00:30:27,856
Guard?

634
00:30:27,880 --> 00:30:28,806
Personal guard?

635
00:30:28,830 --> 00:30:31,620
By order of Grandlord Changgeng,

636
00:30:31,750 --> 00:30:33,110
we brought the Little Prince home.

637
00:30:33,510 --> 00:30:34,660
Changgeng again.

638
00:30:35,200 --> 00:30:36,860
Second Prince Ao Yi's strength

639
00:30:37,000 --> 00:30:39,136
has earned our warriors' respect.

640
00:30:39,160 --> 00:30:40,220
From this day on,

641
00:30:40,550 --> 00:30:42,100
the Mermaid Clan will follow him

642
00:30:42,280 --> 00:30:43,280
and join the East Sea.

643
00:30:43,920 --> 00:30:44,616
Good.

644
00:30:44,640 --> 00:30:45,730
The more, the merrier.

645
00:30:46,160 --> 00:30:47,696
What's so great? She...

646
00:30:47,720 --> 00:30:48,806
Here it comes again.

647
00:30:48,830 --> 00:30:49,830
Here it comes again.

648
00:30:52,350 --> 00:30:53,620
Don't worry.

649
00:30:54,110 --> 00:30:57,140
Watch my cue, play slowly.

650
00:31:05,110 --> 00:31:06,110
Stop.

651
00:31:13,110 --> 00:31:14,250
Still not right.

652
00:31:14,920 --> 00:31:16,700
Yi... Yi...

653
00:31:18,440 --> 00:31:19,086
Wrong again.

654
00:31:19,110 --> 00:31:20,110
Wrong again?

655
00:31:20,350 --> 00:31:21,350
Come on.

656
00:31:21,590 --> 00:31:23,530
Must you be everywhere?

657
00:31:25,350 --> 00:31:28,330
By the order of Grandlord Changgeng,

658
00:31:28,750 --> 00:31:30,006
the Ascendance envoy is here

659
00:31:30,030 --> 00:31:31,856
to escort Ao Yi - Envoy?

660
00:31:31,880 --> 00:31:33,090
Back to the Dragon Palace.

661
00:31:33,310 --> 00:31:35,180
This place

662
00:31:35,310 --> 00:31:36,490
is Ao Yi's home.

663
00:31:36,880 --> 00:31:38,120
Does he need you to escort him?

664
00:31:40,000 --> 00:31:42,620
Days ago, demons besieged Ascendance Sect.

665
00:31:42,720 --> 00:31:45,180
The Little Prince defeated demons as a golden dragon.

666
00:31:45,310 --> 00:31:46,900
He did great deeds for us.

667
00:31:47,110 --> 00:31:47,616
To show sincerity...

668
00:31:47,640 --> 00:31:48,246
A golden dragon?

669
00:31:48,270 --> 00:31:50,010
We brought gifts

670
00:31:50,310 --> 00:31:52,220
to resolve human-dragon enmity.

671
00:31:52,590 --> 00:31:53,620
Ao Yi turned

672
00:31:55,350 --> 00:31:56,490
into a golden dragon?

673
00:32:08,000 --> 00:32:09,090
Wake up, he's here.

674
00:32:09,590 --> 00:32:10,380
Who's here?

675
00:32:10,510 --> 00:32:11,510
He's here!

676
00:32:20,720 --> 00:32:21,856
He's really here!

677
00:32:21,880 --> 00:32:23,330
Play faster, play faster!

678
00:32:23,550 --> 00:32:24,550
Get excited!

679
00:32:25,110 --> 00:32:26,486
Your Majesty, Your Majesty!

680
00:32:26,510 --> 00:32:27,896
He's really here this time.

681
00:32:27,920 --> 00:32:28,376
Who's here?

682
00:32:28,400 --> 00:32:29,400
The Second Prince.

683
00:32:32,110 --> 00:32:33,110
Yi.

684
00:32:36,440 --> 00:32:37,440
Yi.

685
00:32:37,500 --> 00:32:39,086
- You're finally back!
- Father.

686
00:32:39,110 --> 00:32:41,900
Do you know how much I've missed you?

687
00:32:42,480 --> 00:32:43,480
Father.

688
00:32:45,590 --> 00:32:46,616
I ran away from home,

689
00:32:46,640 --> 00:32:47,660
causing you such worry.

690
00:32:48,160 --> 00:32:49,200
Please, punish me, Father.

691
00:32:49,240 --> 00:32:50,416
What matters is you're home safe.

692
00:32:50,440 --> 00:32:51,440
That's what matters.

693
00:32:51,720 --> 00:32:53,456
No matter what hardships

694
00:32:53,480 --> 00:32:54,490
you endured out there,

695
00:32:54,640 --> 00:32:56,086
now that you're back,

696
00:32:56,110 --> 00:32:57,700
no one will dare bully you again.

697
00:32:58,310 --> 00:32:59,310
Father,

698
00:32:59,400 --> 00:33:00,700
I've found a way

699
00:33:00,920 --> 00:33:02,490
to restore our clan's former glory.

700
00:33:05,720 --> 00:33:07,530
You've found a way?

701
00:33:08,440 --> 00:33:09,440
Come.

702
00:33:10,790 --> 00:33:11,790
Look.

703
00:33:25,640 --> 00:33:26,640
This time,

704
00:33:26,750 --> 00:33:29,010
we'll have to foil Westdawn Sect's plot

705
00:33:30,030 --> 00:33:31,490
and complete

706
00:33:32,070 --> 00:33:33,900
the Dragon Clan's ascension plan.

707
00:33:34,160 --> 00:33:36,416
So, the Celestial Court must step in

708
00:33:36,440 --> 00:33:37,800
to resolve the Dragon Clan crisis.

709
00:33:38,000 --> 00:33:39,656
Then, I'll pin the credit

710
00:33:39,680 --> 00:33:40,806
on you.

711
00:33:40,830 --> 00:33:41,830
And the Dragon Clan

712
00:33:42,030 --> 00:33:43,246
will naturally

713
00:33:43,270 --> 00:33:45,180
and willingly come over to your side.

714
00:33:46,830 --> 00:33:47,830
Great idea!

715
00:33:49,350 --> 00:33:52,216
Then, I'll descend to the East Sea

716
00:33:52,240 --> 00:33:53,490
as the Celestial Emperor.

717
00:33:53,750 --> 00:33:54,900
Are you crazy?

718
00:33:55,200 --> 00:33:56,856
If you go to the East Sea,

719
00:33:56,880 --> 00:33:58,286
they'll think it's a coup and rebel.

720
00:33:58,310 --> 00:33:59,310
What then?

721
00:34:01,720 --> 00:34:02,810
Well, what do you suggest?

722
00:34:04,880 --> 00:34:05,880
Well.

723
00:34:06,510 --> 00:34:07,510
I think

724
00:34:08,440 --> 00:34:10,130
we need someone else

725
00:34:10,710 --> 00:34:12,650
to stand for the Celestial Court.

726
00:34:13,070 --> 00:34:14,046
But this person

727
00:34:14,070 --> 00:34:16,980
must be honest, obedient, and discreet.

728
00:34:17,150 --> 00:34:18,686
They can vanish for ten or so days

729
00:34:18,710 --> 00:34:20,046
without anyone noticing.

730
00:34:20,070 --> 00:34:21,070
And the key thing is

731
00:34:21,630 --> 00:34:23,980
they must fit the public's image

732
00:34:24,070 --> 00:34:25,456
of a deity:

733
00:34:25,480 --> 00:34:28,940
white hair, white brows, white beard

734
00:34:35,480 --> 00:34:36,760
flowing robes, and wide sleeves.

735
00:35:01,510 --> 00:35:05,090
I am Moon Elder, envoy of the Celestial Emperor.

736
00:35:07,150 --> 00:35:10,170
By the order of Grandlord Changgeng...

737
00:35:12,000 --> 00:35:13,380
Changgeng again.

738
00:35:13,590 --> 00:35:17,900
I'm here to congratulate the return of Prince Ao Yi.

739
00:35:18,360 --> 00:35:19,820
Your Majesty, Your Majesty!

740
00:35:20,960 --> 00:35:21,960
An immortal envoy!

741
00:35:22,400 --> 00:35:23,400
Oh, an immortal envoy.

742
00:35:32,440 --> 00:35:34,380
So, the immortal envoy is here.

743
00:35:34,440 --> 00:35:35,650
My apologies. Forgive me.

744
00:35:36,800 --> 00:35:37,420
Yi,

745
00:35:37,710 --> 00:35:38,376
it's such a big event.

746
00:35:38,400 --> 00:35:40,210
Why didn't you tell me beforehand?

747
00:35:41,800 --> 00:35:42,340
Turtle,

748
00:35:42,550 --> 00:35:43,896
prepare a feast! A grand feast!

749
00:35:43,920 --> 00:35:44,646
No, no!

750
00:35:44,670 --> 00:35:45,336
I can't drink.

751
00:35:45,360 --> 00:35:46,256
Come on, please.

752
00:35:46,280 --> 00:35:47,126
I can't drink; I already threw up!

753
00:35:47,150 --> 00:35:48,150
Please, please!

754
00:35:49,710 --> 00:35:50,710
No way!

755
00:35:51,110 --> 00:35:52,780
Not again?

756
00:35:52,920 --> 00:35:53,896
Yi,

757
00:35:53,920 --> 00:35:56,050
how many people did you bring back today?

758
00:35:57,000 --> 00:35:58,000
I...

759
00:35:58,800 --> 00:36:00,780
How many should I have brought today?

760
00:36:01,190 --> 00:36:02,420
I have no idea!

761
00:36:08,880 --> 00:36:09,980
Yunxiao.

762
00:36:13,360 --> 00:36:14,420
Fairy Yunxiao.

763
00:36:28,110 --> 00:36:30,896
Fairy Yunxiao, nice to meet you.

764
00:36:30,920 --> 00:36:33,420
What brings you back

765
00:36:33,710 --> 00:36:35,086
to the East Sea?

766
00:36:35,110 --> 00:36:37,570
Sent by Grandlord Changgeng,

767
00:36:37,760 --> 00:36:40,606
I'm here to escort the Prince Ao Yi

768
00:36:40,630 --> 00:36:41,780
back to the Dragon Palace.

769
00:36:52,070 --> 00:36:55,820
You're all sent

770
00:36:56,920 --> 00:36:58,460
by Grandlord Changgeng

771
00:36:59,030 --> 00:37:00,090
to escort my son?

772
00:37:01,920 --> 00:37:02,920
Is that so?

773
00:37:04,110 --> 00:37:05,110
Is that so?

774
00:37:07,320 --> 00:37:09,380
I have a question, though.

775
00:37:09,510 --> 00:37:12,260
Please enlighten me.

776
00:37:13,280 --> 00:37:15,690
Who is Changgeng?

777
00:37:20,030 --> 00:37:21,736
This is hardly a return.

778
00:37:21,760 --> 00:37:23,416
Clearly, he's back to flaunt

779
00:37:23,440 --> 00:37:24,486
