781
00:37:29,190 --> 00:37:31,650
So, he covets my position as the Crown Prince.

782
00:37:31,960 --> 00:37:33,690
To think I cared so much for his safety.

783
00:37:34,320 --> 00:37:35,320
Ao Yi.

784
00:37:36,280 --> 00:37:37,280
He...

785
00:37:37,920 --> 00:37:39,010
He's a jerk!

786
00:37:43,230 --> 00:37:45,420
Grandlord Changgeng of the Sea Deity Sect.

787
00:37:46,550 --> 00:37:47,610
Your Highness,

788
00:37:49,150 --> 00:37:50,490
do you still remember that name?

789
00:37:53,760 --> 00:37:54,760
Changgeng.

790
00:37:56,360 --> 00:37:57,900
How could I forget that name?

791
00:37:59,150 --> 00:38:00,490
All my failures

792
00:38:02,030 --> 00:38:03,340
are thanks to him.

793
00:38:04,110 --> 00:38:05,110
I want revenge.

794
00:38:05,590 --> 00:38:06,740
I'll kill him.

795
00:38:08,030 --> 00:38:10,300
The battle in the South Sea was costly.

796
00:38:11,550 --> 00:38:13,170
You haven't recovered yet.

797
00:38:14,030 --> 00:38:16,090
For now, just rest and recuperate.

798
00:38:16,190 --> 00:38:17,190
Don't bother

799
00:38:18,230 --> 00:38:19,610
with everything else.

800
00:38:25,670 --> 00:38:26,670
Right.

801
00:38:28,320 --> 00:38:29,320
Don't bother with it.

802
00:38:30,880 --> 00:38:31,880
Don't bother with it.

803
00:38:33,280 --> 00:38:34,300
Don't bother with it.

804
00:38:40,150 --> 00:38:41,260
Master Jin Chan,

805
00:38:42,110 --> 00:38:43,260
the Sea Deity Sect...

806
00:38:49,360 --> 00:38:51,130
Ao Yi's return now

807
00:38:52,480 --> 00:38:53,900
is no coincidence.

808
00:38:56,070 --> 00:38:57,690
It's Changgeng's scheme.

809
00:38:59,110 --> 00:39:01,210
He's come to avenge Ascendance Sect.

810
00:39:38,270 --> 00:39:44,050
♪ See mortal joys and sorrows ♪

811
00:39:44,720 --> 00:39:51,420
♪ Reunions and partings, as fate unfolds ♪

812
00:39:52,950 --> 00:39:59,000
♪ Alas, love has many twists and turns ♪

813
00:39:59,630 --> 00:40:06,080
♪ Memories filled with sorrow ♪

814
00:40:06,820 --> 00:40:13,940
♪ Slowly, wishes turn to regret ♪

815
00:40:14,320 --> 00:40:21,220
♪ You've gone afar, like mist fading ♪

816
00:40:21,600 --> 00:40:28,926
♪ Tearfully, this life's bond is not over ♪

817
00:40:28,950 --> 00:40:36,120
♪ Past fragments vanish into night ♪

818
00:40:52,260 --> 00:40:57,430
♪ Down a few more cups of wine ♪

819
00:40:58,520 --> 00:41:05,540
♪ Through land and sea, I ask you to come ♪

820
00:41:06,730 --> 00:41:12,670
♪ For honor's sake, upright and grand ♪

821
00:41:13,370 --> 00:41:20,450
♪ Alas, our story is short ♪

822
